From: Horizon authors <>
Subject: [PATCH] Bake the status mistakes tag and draw one clean virus icon

Repurpose the overlapping cap sprite as the baked mistakes tag. All language
banks keep the same resident table sizes; MENU_REL is unchanged. The remaining filth sprite uses
our outlined 11x11 art; runtime text is retained only for tiredness.

